2"> <table style="width: 100%;"> <tr style="font-weight: bold; color: #fff; background-color: #666;"> <td style="padding: 0 2px; width: 50%;">页面</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; width: 25%; text-align: center;">创建日期</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;">评分</td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="content-type-description"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>所有平台上的消息我应该都会在七天内回复，如果有超过14天和三个平台都没有回话的话（除去某些我事先说过的特殊原因）那应该是人死了。勿念（<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">啊喂也没人会念吧（</span>。</p> </blockquote> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610113975" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span></p> 
